  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. <math alttext=\"20 percent sign\"><mn>20</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"440\"><mn>440</mn>\n</math> can be calculated as <math alttext=\"left parenthesis StartFraction 20 Over 100 EndFraction right parenthesis left parenthesis 440 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mn>440</mn></mfenced></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"StartFraction 8,800 Over 100 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>8,800</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></math>, or <math alttext=\"88\"><mn>88</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This is <math alttext=\"10 percent sign\"><mn>10</mn><mo>%</mo></math>, not <math alttext=\"20 percent sign\"><mn>20</mn><mo>%</mo></math>, of <math alttext=\"440\"><mn>440</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This is <math alttext=\"200 percent sign\"><mn>200</mn><mo>%</mo></math>, not <math alttext=\"20 percent sign\"><mn>20</mn><mo>%</mo></math>, of <math alttext=\"440\"><mn>440</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This is <math alttext=\"400 percent sign\"><mn>400</mn><mo>%</mo></math>, not <math alttext=\"20 percent sign\"><mn>20</mn><mo>%</mo></math>, of <math alttext=\"440\"><mn>440</mn>\n</math>.</p>",
